---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const email = 'zahra@seekthethrill.in';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions — Seek the Thrill"
  description="Terms and conditions for booking and traveling with Seek the Thrill."
>
  <div class="py-16 lg:py-20" style="background-color: var(--color-gray-soft);">
    <div class="container-app max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--color-navy);">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-sm mb-10" style="color: var(--color-gray-text);">Last updated June 2025</p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-navy);">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Booking &amp; Registration</h2>
          <p>By submitting a registration form and paying the advance amount, you are requesting a spot on an STT trip. Confirmation of your booking is subject to payment verification and seat availability. A confirmed spot requires a verified advance payment.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Registrations are accepted on a first-come-first-served basis. Submitting the form without uploading a payment screenshot does not hold your spot.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Payment Terms</h2>
          <p>The advance amount (currently ₹3,000) is required to confirm your booking. The remaining balance is due 15 days before the trip departure date.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Failure to pay the balance by the due date may result in your spot being released without a refund of the advance.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">All payments are currently accepted via UPI only. No credit or debit card payments are accepted at this time.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Cancellation &amp; Refunds</h2>
          <p>Please refer to our <a href="/cancellation/" class="underline" style="color: var(--color-coral);">Cancellation Policy</a> for full details. In summary:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>30+ days before departure: full refund minus ₹500 processing fee</li>
            <li>15–29 days before: 50% refund</li>
            <li>7–14 days before: 25% refund</li>
            <li>Under 7 days: no refund</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">All cancellation requests must be submitted in writing to <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="underline" style="color: var(--color-coral);">{email}</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Liability</h2>
          <p>Adventure travel involves inherent risks. By participating in an STT trip, you acknowledge these risks and agree that Seek the Thrill, its founders, and trip leaders are not liable for injury, illness, loss of property, or other damages arising from participation.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We strongly recommend purchasing comprehensive travel insurance before your trip.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Code of Conduct</h2>
          <p>STT trips are inclusive spaces. We expect all travelers to treat fellow travelers, guides, local communities, and natural environments with respect. Seek the Thrill reserves the right to remove any participant from a trip — without refund — for conduct that violates this principle or endangers others.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Photography &amp; Content</h2>
          <p>By joining an STT trip, you grant Seek the Thrill a non-exclusive license to use photographs or videos featuring you for marketing purposes. If you'd prefer not to be photographed or featured, let us know before the trip and we'll respect that.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Changes to Trips</h2>
          <p>STT reserves the right to modify itineraries, dates, or locations due to safety concerns, weather, natural events, or circumstances outside our control. In such cases, we will offer a full refund or trip credit at your discretion. We do not cover any incidental costs (flights, hotels booked independently) incurred due to trip changes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Questions</h2>
          <p>Reach us at <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="underline" style="color: var(--color-coral);">{email}</a> or on WhatsApp.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
